on"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"IntentAction"}],"title":"IntentAction","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/IntentAction"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An engine for writing interactive fiction in Swift."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto","kind":"symbol","title":"Gnusto","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto"},"doc://Gnusto/documentation/Gnusto/SyntaxRule":{"role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Gnusto\/documentation\/Gnusto\/SyntaxRule","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"One row of the verb table: a pattern of literal words and slots, and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"intent a match produces. Data, not code — games can add rows through their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"verbs"},{"type":"text","text":" block to teach the parser new player-typeable verbs."}],"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SyntaxRule","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"SyntaxRule","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"SyntaxRule","url":"\/documentation\/gnusto\/syntaxrule"}}}